#### Studio Build Plane — `StudioHelpContext` Schema

Assembled client-side when a Studio actor requests help. Contains everything the AI needs to answer questions about a Studio page or field without PHI exposure.

```typescript
interface StudioHelpContext {
  plane: 'studio';
  actorRole: 'studio-admin' | 'studio-deployer' | 'studio-designer' | 'studio-auditor';
  page: {
    route: string;           // e.g. '/pages/members' or '/adapters'
    title: string;           // human-readable page name
    purpose: string;         // one-sentence description of what the page does
    availableActions: string[];  // list of actions available on this page to this role
  };
  field?: {                  // present only for field-level help
    name: string;            // field label, e.g. 'Minimum Form Factor'
    type: string;            // text | select | toggle | number | multiselect
    required: boolean;
    currentValue?: string;   // SAFE values only (non-PHI): e.g. 'desktop', 'side-nav', 'true'
                             // NEVER include: passwords, tokens, API keys, free-text user input
    validValues?: string[];  // for selects/enums: ['phone', 'tablet', 'desktop']
    helpText: string;        // the static tooltip text from ADR-APP-018 §11
    relatedFields?: string[];  // other fields on this page that interact with this one
  };
  portal?: {                 // present when a portal is selected in authoring context
    id: string;
    displayName: string;
    currentVersion: string;
    layout: 'top-nav' | 'side-nav';
    minFormFactor: string;
    licensedProductCount: number;
    locales: string[];
  };
  locale: string;            // active Studio UI locale (BCP-47)
  questionType: 'field' | 'page' | 'howto';
}
```

**System prompt prefix (generated from context):**
```
You are a helpful assistant for Portal Studio, a no-code portal authoring tool built by Gainwell Technologies for Medicaid implementation teams.

The user is a {actorRole} currently on the {page.title} page ({page.route}).
Page purpose: {page.purpose}
Available actions on this page for this role: {page.availableActions.join(', ')}
{if field: The user is asking about the field "{field.name}" ({field.type}). 
  Current value: {field.currentValue || 'not set'}.
  Valid values: {field.validValues?.join(', ') || 'free text'}.
  Field description: {field.helpText}}
{if portal: Active portal: "{portal.displayName}" v{portal.currentVersion}, layout: {portal.layout}}

Answer in {locale}. Be concise and practical. Do not invent features that do not exist.
Only describe what is available on the current page to this role.
```

